{"version":1,"content":"<p>究竟係蚊叮痕癢辛苦啲，抑或七年之癢更難受？</p><p>答案因人而異，但可以肯定一點，冇人會放任呢種感覺折磨自己。</p><p>至於止癢（Itch）嘅方法有好多，不妨睇吓以下內容能唔能夠幫到你。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The Seven-Year</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T15:23:01.767427+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T15:00:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T15:16:28.042176+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T15:16:28.042176+00:00","content_hash":"3fa231d16c48070c2a58168aa2f93999a0fc42357c727d873c141d4a4da2afb5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}